[{"title":"蒋公祠 其二","author":"王兆升","text":"西来紫气傍云明，夫人声华信莫京。\n冈岭已因名德峻，鄱湖更为使君清。\n归鸿附骥登临远，茑草缘松霄汉荣。\n每过旧游吟画锦，几回翘首不胜情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3394,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋月","author":"王宗达","text":"群峰罗海外，秋夜月明时。\n光射鱼龙遁，寒侵乌鹊疑。\n凭虚劳永夕，顾影发清思。\n待取天香落，披襟重挹之。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3395,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"喜雨和韵","author":"何勉","text":"不愁大网漏吞舟，只恐量沙效唱筹。\n百计疗饥终末策，三祈得雨释千忧。\n田间喜色农夫面，沟曲欢声泽水流。\n原隰均沾勤树艺，伫观丰稔遍西畴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3396,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨后口占","author":"何借宜","text":"山山浮翠远，处处落红深。\n独立柴门外，长歌托素心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3397,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"有感","author":"吴应造","text":"盖棺清议自难逃，华衮方荣一字褒。\n假若生前堪论定，谦恭王莽孝廉曹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3398,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春风","author":"吴观域","text":"才解寒冰蹙细鳞，还来陌上度芳尘。\n香生帘幕人如醉，暖过园林绿渐匀。\n麦陇晴中吹浪远，柳阴浓处送歌频。\n年年二十四番信，幻出繁华刺眼新。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3399,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新绿","author":"吴观域","text":"春老红将瘦，柔芳黛色涵。\n密疑和露染，高渐与天参。\n接叶迷三径，浓阴锁一龛。\n半帘风力细，深院雨声酣。\n暖映溶溶水，遥添叠叠岚。\n云来还衬白，烟过欲拖蓝。\n鸟弄枝间语，鱼游影里潭。\n霭生书幌润，翠滴袷衣湛。\n颇觉良辰好，因思往事谙。\n碧纱窗绕槛，金勒马停骖。\n望远高楼倚，寻幽近郭探。\n凤城极目处，频唱忆江南。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3400,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"二赞行桥","author":"吴观域","text":"竹溪双渡涨溪流，草绿寒烟拂拳头。\n马足欲前还又却，数湾春水冷于秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3401,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赤嵌城","author":"宋永清","text":"城俯汪洋岛屿孤，周遭楼阁倚菰蒲。\n一番风雨醒残梦，万顷波涛冷壮图。\n戍卒戈船蟠地利，桑麻鸡犬附天都。\n闾阎近已敷文教，不是殊方旧楷模。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3402,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画秋村叠嶂图","author":"李中素","text":"分明山水武陵春，却写秋光隔四邻。\n不著胭脂轻一点，恐将花片误渔人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3403,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海会寺","author":"李钦文","text":"回思往事白云间，止有青松不解颜。\n鱼鼓高低忙处响，鸟笙上下静中环。\n天开海国莲称社，月映蜂台禅闭关。\n休问当年衰盛事，于今长见老僧閒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3404,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"别澎湖十六韵","author":"周于仁","text":"行年将六十，三仕到澎阳。\n海国东南峤，星经牛女乡。\n天悬青共远，水接碧同长。\n飓发疑雷吼，沙飞似雾茫。\n有时奔万马，无计卧双樯。\n风景虽多别，民情却甚良。\n勤耕蓣作饭，俭用布为裳。\n麦稻还须籴，豆麻尚可粮。\n黍黄村火密，草绿讼庭荒。\n柴户何尝闭，蒲鞭不用扬。\n官閒惟啸月，民乐可烹羊。\n窃禄亦云久，留名敢谓芳。\n光阴飞石火，花甲变星霜。\n将别还延伫，思归欲束装。\n群黎虽祖饯，一苇早轻杭。\n暂息鹭州地，追怀赋短章。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3405,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"罗山志别","author":"周钟瑄","text":"从宦无功已自羞，那堪别绪更绸缪。\n简书祇许三年住，去志难将十日留。\n重叠云山当客路，迷离烟树绕新愁。\n牵衣稚子痴于我，错把周侯作细侯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3406,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春郊","author":"林材","text":"春明锦绣杏花天，十里香风阡陌连。\n昨夜雨声鸣落叶，晓来蓑笠满桑田。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3407,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"旂尾秋蒐","author":"林材","text":"山如展旆簇东南，讲武年年秋待三。\n风动龙旌辉凤岫，日临?铠耀蛟潭。\n飞麋不逐金弹落，狡兔乍逢雕羽探。\n岂是振威徒纵猎，欲教深谷避髼鬖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3408,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登红毛城诗","author":"林凤飞","text":"海畔孤城落日昏，水天无际欲销魂。\n云拖两脚鲲身岛，风送潮头鹿耳门。\n堪笑霸图归幻梦，独留遗迹吊寒暄。\n纡回磴路谁过问，止有萋萋细草痕。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3409,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"安平晚渡","author":"林翼池","text":"薄暮津头唤渡喧，斜阳晻暧水中天。\n红毛城掩桄榔雾，黑齿人攀椰子烟。\n新月送将名利客，好风吹尽去来船。\n南飞乌鹊今何在，击楫中流记昔年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3410,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画 其一","author":"洪沧洲","text":"千寻瀑布飞晴雨，百尺长松拂暮烟。\n欲上奇峰最高处，携诗一问泬寥天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3411,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画 其二","author":"洪沧洲","text":"风皱波纹含鸭绿，雨添山色拥螺青。\n个中颇具云林派，嘉木低垂一草亭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3412,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"二十六日晚泊澎湖","author":"范咸","text":"计程问澎湖，取道疑已远。\n沿洄逾七更，花屿杳难辨。\n金乌已西落，风微柁欲转。\n黑沟惊狂澜，横洋畏屯蹇。\n传闻弱水近，东去不复返。\n岂必饱鱼腹，窃自轻轩冕。\n藤縆数百尺，用试水深浅。\n俄见白鸟飞，色喜定残喘。\n澳岛三十六，卷石非绝巘。\n潮势觉已平，欠伸求息偃。\n收篷且寄泊，努力进餐饭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3413,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"二十八日入鹿耳门过七鲲身","author":"范咸","text":"遥见青山似画屏，铁嶕捩柁费丁宁。\n荡缨有路分沙线，浮海何人续水经。\n乌鬼渡寒遮鹿耳，荷兰城坼扫王庭。\n鲲身久绝鲸鲵迹，风起不闻战血腥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3414,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"三月二十五日渡海纪所见","author":"范咸","text":"海门峡如束，放舟还趁潮。\n岛屿渐以远，仰视惟云霄。\n天与水为一，远帆同秋毫。\n极目杳无际，意气惨不骄。\n问程藉指南，出海称人豪。\n亚班揽篷索，上下等悬猱。\n巨浪拍天起，比似桅樯高。\n龙骨从上过，一落轻于毛。\n远望峻岭矗，水沸山岳摇。\n柁师噤不语，谓是鲲鱼尻。\n喷沬散作雨，十里闻腥臊。\n转瞬无所睹，但觉心旌愮。\n晚霞日初落，星斗何迢迢。\n夜黑青燐生，非鬼亦非妖。\n燄燄千万点，谁将十斛抛。\n此景洵奇绝，坐看过中宵。\n鸡鸣天欲曙，华彩掀波涛。\n天吴与紫凤，野火春风烧。\n万顷荡金碧，蛟鼍争潜逃。\n动心复駴目，快事倾醇醪。\n幸逢圣御宇，海宴无飘飖。\n生平见未见，恣意誇同曹。\n得藉沧溟力，永静番俗嚣。\n归将画蓬壶，游仙足解嘲。\n笑语金华人，局蹐虚鸣镳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3415,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"露香亭即事","author":"范咸","text":"夜凉树垂露，晨清花放香。\n坐觉幽意适，不知白日长。\n守宫鸣前楹，互答怪蝉螀。\n机事久已息，掉臂惊螳螂。\n感此发深喟，世态何张皇。\n营营名利窟，私欲羞难量。\n曷弗顺大化，鼓腹游虞唐。\n青青木兰树，金粟同芬芳。\n离离赪桐枝，火燄烧扶桑。\n但逞颜色好，终非金玉章。\n吾生更何求，返璞是所望。\n亢龙应有悔，大道归敛藏。\n君子日乾乾，慎守千金方。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3416,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"野宿","author":"孙元衡","text":"秋云向暮总阴森，竹屋卑栖枳棘林。\n风外叶鸣山鸟怪，雨中灯静寺钟沈。\n瘴烟作祟香先到，积水生寒夜渐深。\n耳目悲凉成底事，草虫还为发孤吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3417,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠别","author":"徐元","text":"蹉跎岁月独支离，愁绪今朝欲上眉。\n海外已为三载客，囊中惟剩一瓢诗。\n安贫不用怜原宪，处约无求说项斯。\n但得百钱常挂杖，何劳仙子进琼卮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3418,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"立春","author":"书山","text":"阳和回驭岁更新，人物雍熙岛屿春。\n澥谷条风吹彩仗，青郊小雨浥纤尘。\n梅花竹叶閒中味，柑酒辛盘客底身。\n不效东坡戴幡胜，肯教辜负度良辰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3419,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"劝农归路经海会寺与诸同人分赋 其一","author":"书山","text":"雨后劝农毕，还寻古刹来。\n钟声飘藓径，衲子出香台。\n刺竹排檐种，优昙满院开。\n分题禅榻畔，小憩水云隈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3420,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"弥陀寺","author":"书山","text":"秀色园林夕照明，浮岚卷尽竹烟清。\n去来小蝶花间舞，断续秋蝉叶底鸣。\n几处平台凉影淡，数层敞榭翠涛倾。\n耽幽衲子应间坐，读罢愣严诗又成。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3421,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"暮秋郊行","author":"书成","text":"循行岂是补春游，揽辔轻驰谢眺洲。\n岸接小桥村路曲，烟凝萧寺梵钟幽。\n尘怀顿向閒中涤，野况都从望里收。\n风日蹉跎秋过半，家家场圃筑西畴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3422,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"东宁十咏","author":"高拱乾","text":"三秋闻见总萧骚，日夜飞涛不断号。\n旧集闾阎皆斥卤，新开原野半蓬蒿。\n空山那得珠崖贝，伏莽休悬渤海刀。\n应识乘轺难塞责，愿纾南顾圣躬劳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3423,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赤嵌夕照","author":"高祖彭","text":"百尺高楼镇海东，夕阳斜映满城红。\n分明绘出皇图□。\n想见当年汗血功。","collection":"清","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3424,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨中观潮","author":"张若霳","text":"沧溟水涨连天起，澎湃奔腾万马喧。\n声撼鲲身银浪转，光摇鹿耳玉山翻。\n萧条古木寒无色，淅沥长廊酒满尊。\n万壑千岩都不见，天涯风雨正黄昏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3425,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"澄台观海次巡宪六公韵","author":"张若霳","text":"耸立凭栏荡远眸，海天一碧望中收。\n鲸鱼潜伏三千浪，鹏鸟高抟九万秋。\n极目无情逢幻市，近山有意觅琼楼。\n会当上献安期枣，看取沧溟瑞色浮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3426,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春郊即事","author":"张从政","text":"独上高原去，怀开眼界空。\n傍溪馀竹翠，隔岸见桃红。\n草发春前雨，马嘶柳外风。\n双柑与斗酒，逸兴谁能同。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3427,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋登城楼","author":"张从政","text":"草舍多寥寂，心孤易感秋。\n岸遥枫欲老，江外雨初收。\n砧向夕阳急，鸦依古树投。\n情深王粲赋，日暮独登楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3428,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"澄台小集叠韵","author":"张湄","text":"澄台嘉樾密戎戎，醉后凭高四望通。\n岛市别开帆影外，天垠纯浸水光中。\n迢遥亲舍孤云拥，浩渺予怀碧海同。\n日午南薰方荐爽，当风不复辨雌雄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3429,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五妃墓","author":"张湄","text":"瘗玉埋香骨未尘，五妃青冢草长春。\n云寒孤岛魂相聚，直抵田横五百人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3430,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"榕梁","author":"张湄","text":"绿莎厅后影扶疏，龙卧虹垂曲更舒。\n若比渔梁临水次，未妨缘木一求鱼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3431,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"聚星园","author":"张湄","text":"梧竹阴森护短垣，群峰飞落聚星园。\n海翁九十发如鹤，门外水田秋稼繁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3432,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鹿耳门","author":"张湄","text":"铁板交横鹿耳排，路穿沙线几纡回。\n浪花堆里双缨在，更遣渔舟向导来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3433,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海会寺","author":"张湄","text":"歌罢蛮腔易梵腔，层楼烟际晚钟撞。\n吟诗赌弈人稀到，閒煞孤寒白菊窗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3434,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"小西天","author":"张湄","text":"竹溪小寺远尘廛，青壁临流薜荔悬。\n高望美人何处所，漫凭东海说西天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3435,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七鲲身","author":"张湄","text":"鬐翼连翩振地垠，风抟水击势难驯。\n鹏图孰是南溟好，愿尔长安徙海身。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3436,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"澎湖","author":"张湄","text":"三十六屿如排衙，渔舍参差烟火赊。\n塞里风多异南北，莫教海客误停槎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3437,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海道","author":"张湄","text":"七更针路指澎湖，秘本流传近有无。\n此地未须论道里，风生八面往来殊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3438,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雁门烟雨","author":"陈汝缵","text":"雁门春霭路，烟雨几重山。\n马迹遥程滑，樵歌冷韵间。\n岚浮横瀑影，径曲绣苔斑。\n转折深林外，村庐湿翠环。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3439,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟次早行","author":"陈廷和","text":"蘼芜平野阔，一望晓烟青。\n戍鼓催残月，樯旗汎落星。\n轻舟宜浅濑，落叶见林坰。\n背指经过处，飞鸥已满汀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3440,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梦蝶园怀李正青先生 其一","author":"陈宗达","text":"梦蝶人何在，空馀此地名。\n只今芳草绿，千载有馀清。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3441,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"丁酉1717正月初五夜罗山署中大风次早风歇饮酒纪之以诗","author":"陈梦林","text":"海西蛰起蛟龙怒，昨夜海吼风不住。\n风声入耳骇人闻，风势如痴复如飓。\n客子残灯半灭明，闭门欹枕空百虑。\n山房四柱柱影摇，有时风欲挟之去。\n万马蹄奔剑戟鸣，虎豹搏噬急雨注。\n往来嘈杂不成眠，一夜梦魂无宿处。\n平明起视浮云决，风力渐微声渐歇。\n呼童煖酒赏春朝，似怯寒吹帘幔彻。\n因忆去年腊月初，番仔渡头朔风烈。\n番社纷纷乱捲茅，竹树倒披梢半折。\n耳鼻填沙眼怕开，行人却走马蹩躠。\n山溪狂似海波潮，溪水冷于轴头铁。\n双犊乱流车苦迟，番儿强挽肤破裂。\n下马停车权息肩，店舍无烟酒不热。\n番儿力尽冻且僵，呼起聊为哺与啜。\n可怜幅布半围身，青钱那惜恣饕餮。\n此时如我敢言寒，犹有敝裘重补缀。\n况复今朝风已春，窗明几净椒盘新。\n水仙香发绿尊满，春冷无眠奚足嚚。\n风波自古仗忠信，念尔孤篷海上人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3442,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登红毛城","author":"陈慧","text":"回想当年匠石工，层层叠绕捲长风。\n波流远去潮声急，山势飞来地脉雄。\n几叶渔舟隐现里，数村烟火渺茫中。\n而今一眺情何限，鹿耳沙鲲壮海东。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3443,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"小斋","author":"陈辉","text":"僻处心常静，幽栖意自閒。\n种花分隙地，闭户似深山。\n日映浓华里，风摇积翠间。\n不须寻酒伴，独坐亦开颜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3444,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中秋书感","author":"陈辉","text":"碧汉无尘一色秋，疏星片月淡云收。\n霜沾桂树寒香满，露滴桐梢瘦影幽。\n几曲微吟依海岸，半空清响起江楼。\n谁家玉笛横吹里，却把关山惹客愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3445,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五妃墓","author":"陈辉","text":"精诚归帝子，大节凛冰霜。\n慷慨同千古，从容共一堂。\n兰焚山失色，玉瘗土留香。\n捲地悲风至，萧萧起白杨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3446,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日 其二","author":"陈辉","text":"韶华向曙海天开，红蕊青枝照水隈。\n镇日书窗无客至，小帘风煖燕飞来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3447,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋吟","author":"陈辉","text":"竹院萧萧里，微风度碧栏。\n怀人花共瘦，踏月影同寒。\n砧杵敲何急，衾裯梦觉单。\n长吟非有恨，只怕听更残。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3448,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋雨后即事","author":"陈辉","text":"残雨新添一色秋，小窗开处见清幽。\n箫吹淡月通溪店，漏滴寒空近戍楼。\n对影孤吟悲宋玉，惊魂断梦忆庄周。\n雁飞不到台阳路，怅望天涯芦荻洲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3449,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"郊行古意","author":"陈辉","text":"辛苦远行人，寂寞溪山路。\n云水隔疏村，渺渺横烟雾。\n鸡声出竹篱，高树滴微露。\n负耒有农夫，行歌临野渡。\n竹筏散不收，一篙不知处。\n惊起白鸥飞，低拂芦花去。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3450,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟古","author":"陈辉","text":"庭东一树桃，庭西数竿竹。\n桃花春既秾，篱笋夏初绿。\n爰有幽隐人，对之作迈轴。\n桃竹向时荣，斯人甘淡薄。\n饮露餍晨蔬，采摘不盈掬。\n可当黄绮芝，霞炊石火熟。\n可当夷齐薇，云煨青山斸。\n鸿飞远冥冥，寥廓无曲局。\n莫食田间粱，谁能任拘束。\n所以君子修，清操常不辱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3451,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水帘","author":"陈锡圭","text":"水晶风动挂高天，石洞玲珑俯百川。\n神女香奁临镜罢，山僧锡杖倚云悬。\n双飞乳燕迷芳草，独耀银蟾隔紫烟。\n便觉林栖无俗韵，好教户牖发清姘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3452,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"竹栈","author":"陈锡圭","text":"谁向瀼西歌竹枝，天涯迢递路参差。\n横桥自泻清溪水，曲径遥通绿草池。\n几道舆梁劳结搆，一川烟雨自迷离。\n那堪送客春深候，柳色青青匹马迟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3453,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"松关","author":"陈锡圭","text":"连天叠翠护名山，谁辟松阴数亩间。\n隐映危楼残戍险，参差鸟道暮樵还。\n昂藏不逐星霜老，倔强潜消岁月间。\n待看龙蟠风雨夜，依稀百二古秦关。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3454,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蕉屏","author":"陈锡圭","text":"烟绡雾縠软屏横，好句留题藉管城。\n画雪司空真可圣，衔杯学士欲逃名。\n斜分竹色侵庭翠，远拨梅香入梦清。\n忆我山窗风雨夜，不堪滴沥到天明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3455,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"斐亭听涛","author":"陆广霖","text":"疏影萧萧万籁平，江亭忽听怒涛鸣。\n乍疑檐角风敲玉，顿觉丛中浪拍城。\n岛屿波洄凭竹报，筼筜声寂待潮生。\n远臣仰沐澄清久，跨海鲸鲵静不惊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":3456,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]